    },
    "message": "Encode a new EventLog record from its frozen fields without thawing it\n\nrecord_json gives the bytes record.to_dict() gave, for a record of frozen plain values;\nany other record takes the Python path. Checkpoints and frames of the seven-day gate\nare byte-identical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
